{"content": {"associated": {"p10": [{"aid": "169523796", "attribs": {"data-aid": "169523796", "id": "p_iuzsG"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_dgJHe-p_zM7Ro#p_dgJHe\" data-publication=\"Exodus 7–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/65104492b0dd11eea1f9eeeeac1e0b9b7c6641e8/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">How were Pharaoh’s magicians able to imitate some of the miracles performed by Moses and Aaron?</a>"}, "heading": "How were Pharaoh’s magicians able to imitate some of the miracles performed by Moses and Aaron?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&id=p_dgJHe-p_zM7Ro#p_dgJHe", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"165109601\" id=\"p_dgJHe\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p10-p12%2Cp20-p22#p10\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/7.html?id=p10-p12,p20-p22#p10\">Exodus 7:10–12, 20–22</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p6-p7#p6\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/8.html?id=p6-p7#p6\">8:6–7</a></p></div>", "id": "p_iuzsG", "key": "p10", "marker": "10", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128419105", "title": "Exodus 7–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}], "p13": [{"aid": "169523794", "attribs": {"data-aid": "169523794", "id": "p_iVlCG"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_tfgmb-p_oYa0v#p_tfgmb\" data-publication=\"Exodus 7–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/65104492b0dd11eea1f9eeeeac1e0b9b7c6641e8/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">Did God harden Pharaoh’s heart?</a>"}, "heading": "Did God harden Pharaoh’s heart?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&id=p_tfgmb-p_oYa0v#p_tfgmb", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"165109551\" id=\"p_tfgmb\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p3%2Cp13#p3\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/7.html?id=p3,p13#p3\">Exodus 7:3, 13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/9.html?id=p12#p12\">9:12</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p1%2Cp20%2Cp27#p1\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/10.html?id=p1,p20,p27#p1\">10:1, 20, 27</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/11.html?id=p10#p10\">11:10</a></p></div>", "id": "p_iVlCG", "key": "p13", "marker": "13", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128419112", "title": "Exodus 7–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}], "p20": [{"aid": "169523797", "attribs": {"data-aid": "169523797", "id": "p_sCwEI"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_dgJHe-p_zM7Ro#p_dgJHe\" data-publication=\"Exodus 7–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/65104492b0dd11eea1f9eeeeac1e0b9b7c6641e8/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">How were Pharaoh’s magicians able to imitate some of the miracles performed by Moses and Aaron?</a>"}, "heading": "How were Pharaoh’s magicians able to imitate some of the miracles performed by Moses and Aaron?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&id=p_dgJHe-p_zM7Ro#p_dgJHe", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"165109601\" id=\"p_dgJHe\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p10-p12%2Cp20-p22#p10\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/7.html?id=p10-p12,p20-p22#p10\">Exodus 7:10–12, 20–22</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p6-p7#p6\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/8.html?id=p6-p7#p6\">8:6–7</a></p></div>", "id": "p_sCwEI", "key": "p20", "marker": "20", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128419129", "title": "Exodus 7–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}], "p3": [{"aid": "169523793", "attribs": {"data-aid": "169523793", "id": "p_oK5BF"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_tfgmb-p_oYa0v#p_tfgmb\" data-publication=\"Exodus 7–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/65104492b0dd11eea1f9eeeeac1e0b9b7c6641e8/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">Did God harden Pharaoh’s heart?</a>"}, "heading": "Did God harden Pharaoh’s heart?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&id=p_tfgmb-p_oYa0v#p_tfgmb", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"165109551\" id=\"p_tfgmb\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p3%2Cp13#p3\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/7.html?id=p3,p13#p3\">Exodus 7:3, 13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/9.html?id=p12#p12\">9:12</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p1%2Cp20%2Cp27#p1\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/10.html?id=p1,p20,p27#p1\">10:1, 20, 27</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/11.html?id=p10#p10\">11:10</a></p></div>", "id": "p_oK5BF", "key": "p3", "marker": "3", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128419088", "title": "Exodus 7–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}], "title_number1": [{"aid": "164529430", "attribs": {"data-aid": "164529430", "id": "aside1_p1"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/old-testament-stories-2022/the-plagues-of-egypt?lang=eng\" data-publication=\"The Plagues of Egypt\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21320%2C/0/default\">The Plagues of Egypt</a>"}, "href": "/study/manual/old-testament-stories-2022/the-plagues-of-egypt?lang=eng", "id": "aside1_p1", "image": {"src": "https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21320%2C/0/default", "srcset": "https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%21800%2C/0/default 800w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%211280%2C/0/default 1280w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%211600%2C/0/default 1600w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%211920%2C/0/default 1920w, https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/61d10a661a8f04574e470929fc2e39bf9cbffd55/full/%213840%2C/0/default 3840w"}, "key": "title_number1", "marker": "", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Old Testament Stories"}, "pid": "128419078", "title": "The Plagues of Egypt", "type": "text"}, {"aid": "169523795", "attribs": {"data-aid": "169523795", "id": "p_hdRN8"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_cEFBL-p_juoTq#p_cEFBL\" data-publication=\"Exodus 7–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/65104492b0dd11eea1f9eeeeac1e0b9b7c6641e8/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">Why did the Lord send plagues upon Egypt?</a>"}, "heading": "Why did the Lord send plagues upon Egypt?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-old-testament/13-exodus-7-13?lang=eng&id=p_cEFBL-p_juoTq#p_cEFBL", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"165109558\" id=\"p_cEFBL\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/ot/ex/7?lang=eng\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/ot/ex/7.html\">Exodus 7–11</a></p></div>", "id": "p_hdRN8", "key": "title_number1", "marker": "", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: Old Testament"}, "pid": "128419078", "title": "Exodus 7–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}]}, "body": "<header>\n<span class=\"page-break\" data-page=\"88\"></span>\n<p class=\"title-number\" data-aid=\"128419078\" id=\"title_number1\">Chapter 7</p>\n<p class=\"study-summary\" data-aid=\"128419080\" id=\"study_summary1\">Moses is appointed to give the word of the Lord to Pharaoh—The Lord will multiply signs and wonders in Egypt—Aaron’s rod becomes a serpent—The river is turned into blood—The magicians imitate the miracles of Moses and Aaron.</p>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419082\" data-eng-ref=\"7:1\" id=\"p1\"><span class=\"verse-number\">1 </span>And the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> said unto Moses, See, I have made thee <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note1_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>a</a> <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note1_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>god</a> to Pharaoh: and Aaron thy brother shall be thy <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note1_c\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"c\"></sup>prophet</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419085\" data-eng-ref=\"7:2\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"verse-number\">2 </span>Thou shalt speak all that I <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note2_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>command</a> thee: and Aaron thy brother shall speak unto Pharaoh, that he send the children of Israel out of his land.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419088\" data-eng-ref=\"7:3\" id=\"p3\"><span class=\"verse-number\">3 </span><a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note3_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>And</a> I will harden Pharaoh’s heart, and multiply my signs and my <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note3_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>wonders</a> in the land of Egypt.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419090\" data-eng-ref=\"7:4\" id=\"p4\"><span class=\"verse-number\">4 </span><a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>But</a> Pharaoh shall not hearken unto you, that I may lay my hand upon Egypt, and bring forth mine <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note4_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>armies</a>, <span class=\"clarity-word\">and</span> my people the children of Israel, out of the land of Egypt by great judgments.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419093\" data-eng-ref=\"7:5\" id=\"p5\"><span class=\"verse-number\">5 </span>And the Egyptians shall <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note5_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>know</a> that <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note5_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>I <span class=\"clarity-word\">am</span></a> the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note5_c\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"c\"></sup><span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span></a>, when I stretch forth mine hand upon Egypt, and bring out the children of Israel from among them.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419095\" data-eng-ref=\"7:6\" id=\"p6\"><span class=\"verse-number\">6 </span>And Moses and Aaron did as the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> commanded them, so did they.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419098\" data-eng-ref=\"7:7\" id=\"p7\"><span class=\"verse-number\">7 </span>And Moses <span class=\"clarity-word\">was</span> <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note7_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>fourscore</a> years old, and <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note7_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>Aaron</a> fourscore and three years old, when they spake unto Pharaoh.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419100\" data-eng-ref=\"7:8\" id=\"p8\"><span class=\"verse-number\">8 </span><span class=\"para-mark\">¶ </span>And the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> spake unto Moses and unto Aaron, saying,</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419102\" data-eng-ref=\"7:9\" id=\"p9\"><span class=\"verse-number\">9 </span>When Pharaoh shall speak unto you, saying, <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note9_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>Shew</a> a <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note9_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>miracle</a> for you: then thou shalt say unto Aaron, Take thy rod, and cast <span class=\"clarity-word\">it</span> before Pharaoh, <span class=\"clarity-word\">and</span> it shall become a serpent.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419105\" data-eng-ref=\"7:10\" id=\"p10\"><span class=\"verse-number\">10 </span><span class=\"para-mark\">¶ </span>And Moses and Aaron went in unto Pharaoh, and they did so as the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> had commanded: and Aaron cast down his rod before Pharaoh, and before his servants, and it became a serpent.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419107\" data-eng-ref=\"7:11\" id=\"p11\"><span class=\"verse-number\">11 </span>Then Pharaoh also called the wise men and the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note11_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>sorcerers</a>: now the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note11_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>magicians</a> of Egypt, they also did in like manner with their enchantments.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419110\" data-eng-ref=\"7:12\" id=\"p12\"><span class=\"verse-number\">12 </span>For they cast down every man his rod, and they became serpents: but Aaron’s rod swallowed up their rods.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419112\" data-eng-ref=\"7:13\" id=\"p13\"><span class=\"verse-number\">13 </span><a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note13_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>And</a> he hardened Pharaoh’s heart, that he hearkened not unto them; as the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> had said.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419115\" data-eng-ref=\"7:14\" id=\"p14\"><span class=\"verse-number\">14 </span><span class=\"para-mark\">¶ </span>And the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> said unto Moses, Pharaoh’s heart <span class=\"clarity-word\">is</span> hardened, he refuseth to let the people go.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419117\" data-eng-ref=\"7:15\" id=\"p15\"><span class=\"verse-number\">15 </span>Get thee unto Pharaoh in the morning; lo, he goeth out unto the water; and thou shalt stand by the river’s brink <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note15_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>against he come</a>; and the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note15_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>rod</a> which was turned to a serpent shalt thou take in thine hand.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419120\" data-eng-ref=\"7:16\" id=\"p16\"><span class=\"verse-number\">16 </span>And thou shalt say unto him, The <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note16_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>God</a> of the Hebrews hath sent me unto thee, saying, Let my people go, that they may <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note16_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>serve</a> me in the wilderness: and, behold, hitherto thou wouldest not hear.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419122\" data-eng-ref=\"7:17\" id=\"p17\"><span class=\"verse-number\">17 </span>Thus saith the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span>, In this thou shalt know that I <span class=\"clarity-word\">am</span> the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span>: behold, I will smite with the rod that <span class=\"clarity-word\">is</span> in mine hand upon the waters which <span class=\"clarity-word\">are</span> in the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note17_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>river</a>, and they shall be <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note17_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>turned</a> to <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note17_c\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"c\"></sup>blood</a>.</p>\n<span class=\"page-break\" data-page=\"89\"></span>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419125\" data-eng-ref=\"7:18\" id=\"p18\"><span class=\"verse-number\">18 </span>And the fish that <span class=\"clarity-word\">is</span> in the river shall die, and the river shall stink; and the Egyptians shall lothe to drink of the water of the river.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419127\" data-eng-ref=\"7:19\" id=\"p19\"><span class=\"verse-number\">19 </span><span class=\"para-mark\">¶ </span>And the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> spake unto Moses, Say unto Aaron, Take thy rod, and stretch out thine hand upon the waters of Egypt, upon their streams, upon their rivers, and upon their ponds, and upon all their pools of water, that they may become <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note19_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>blood</a>; and <span class=\"clarity-word\">that</span> there may be blood throughout all the land of Egypt, both in <span class=\"clarity-word\">vessels of</span> wood, and in <span class=\"clarity-word\">vessels of</span> stone.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419129\" data-eng-ref=\"7:20\" id=\"p20\"><span class=\"verse-number\">20 </span>And Moses and Aaron did so, as the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> commanded; and he lifted up the <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note20_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>rod</a>, and smote the waters that <span class=\"clarity-word\">were</span> in the river, in the sight of Pharaoh, and in the sight of his servants; and all the waters that <span class=\"clarity-word\">were</span> in the river were turned to <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note20_b\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"b\"></sup>blood</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419131\" data-eng-ref=\"7:21\" id=\"p21\"><span class=\"verse-number\">21 </span>And the fish that <span class=\"clarity-word\">was</span> in the river died; and the river stank, and the Egyptians could not drink of the water of the river; and there was blood throughout all the land of Egypt.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419133\" data-eng-ref=\"7:22\" id=\"p22\"><span class=\"verse-number\">22 </span>And the magicians of Egypt did so with their enchantments: and Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, neither did he hearken unto them; as the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> had said.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419135\" data-eng-ref=\"7:23\" id=\"p23\"><span class=\"verse-number\">23 </span>And Pharaoh turned and went into his house, <a class=\"study-note-ref\" href=\"#note23_a\"><sup class=\"marker\" data-value=\"a\"></sup>neither</a> did he set his heart to this also.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419137\" data-eng-ref=\"7:24\" id=\"p24\"><span class=\"verse-number\">24 </span>And all the Egyptians digged round about the river for water to drink; for they could not drink of the water of the river.</p>\n<p class=\"verse\" data-aid=\"128419139\" data-eng-ref=\"7:25\" id=\"p25\"><span class=\"verse-number\">25 </span>And seven days were fulfilled, after that the <span class=\"deity-name\"><span class=\"small-caps\">Lord</span></span> had smitten the river.</p>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"study-notes\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"chapter\">\n<li data-marker=\"7\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"verse\">\n<li data-marker=\"1\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note1_a\" data-full-marker=\"1a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419140\" id=\"note1_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"or\"><small>OR</small> as God.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note1_b\" data-full-marker=\"1b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419142\" id=\"note1_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"jst\"><small>JST</small> Ex. 7:1 … <em>prophet</em> … </span><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Ex. 4:16</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"c\" id=\"note1_c\" data-full-marker=\"1c\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419144\" id=\"note1_c_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"jst\"><small>JST</small> Ex. 7:1 … <em>spokesman.</em> </span><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/priesthood-keys-of?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Priesthood, Keys of</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/prophecy?lang=eng\">Prophecy</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/prophets-mission-of?lang=eng\">Prophets, Mission of</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"2\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note2_a\" data-full-marker=\"2a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419146\" id=\"note2_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/authority?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Authority</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"3\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note3_a\" data-full-marker=\"3a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419147\" id=\"note3_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"jst\"><small>JST</small> Ex. 7:3 And <em>Pharaoh</em> will harden <em>his</em> heart, <em>as I said unto thee;</em> and <em>thou shalt</em> multiply my signs …</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note3_b\" data-full-marker=\"3b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419149\" id=\"note3_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/miracle?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Miracle</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"4\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note4_a\" data-full-marker=\"4a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419151\" id=\"note4_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"or\"><small>OR</small> But if Pharaoh will not hearken … then I will …</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note4_b\" data-full-marker=\"4b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419152\" id=\"note4_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/105?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">D&amp;C 105:26</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"5\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note5_a\" data-full-marker=\"5a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419154\" id=\"note5_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Ex. 14:4</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note5_b\" data-full-marker=\"5b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419156\" id=\"note5_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/neh/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p6-p10#p10\">Neh. 9:10 (6–10)</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"c\" id=\"note5_c\" data-full-marker=\"5c\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419157\" id=\"note5_c_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Ex. 8:10</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"7\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note7_a\" data-full-marker=\"7a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419159\" id=\"note7_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/31?lang=eng&amp;id=p1-p2#p2\">Deut. 31:2 (1–2)</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/34?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">34:7</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Acts 7:23</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note7_b\" data-full-marker=\"7b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419161\" id=\"note7_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"cross-ref\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p14-p27#p20\">Ex. 6:20 (14–27)</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/num/33?lang=eng&amp;id=p39#p39\">Num. 33:39</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"9\">\n<ul class=\"marker\" data-type=\"marker\">\n<li data-marker=\"a\" id=\"note9_a\" data-full-marker=\"9a\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419163\" id=\"note9_a_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"or\"><small>OR</small> Prove yourselves by performing a miracle.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-marker=\"b\" id=\"note9_b\" data-full-marker=\"9b\">\n<p data-aid=\"128419164\" id=\"note9_b_p1\"><span data-note-category=\"tg\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/sign-seekers?lang=eng\"><small>TG</small> Sign Seekers</a>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-marker